        "flow_id": "flow_000_execute_i_launchDriveToExecute_1"
      },
      "summary": "This flow distributes a single launch event from the launch stage through a fifo, splitter, and selector network to fan out to multiple execution units and register file paths.",
      "subject": "flow_000_execute_i_launchDriveToExecute_1",
      "explanation": "The flow starts at i_launchDriveToExecute_1, passes through exeFifo2 for buffering, then enters executeSplitter which fans out to exeSelector (for ALU/execution units) and op3Selector (for operand 3 paths). The exeSelector further fans out to multiple mutex merges feeding add, and, eor, or, div, mul, hsb, rev, shift, align, and res units. The op3Selector fans out to lsuSele1 (for LSU interaction) and op3NormalSelector (for wait merges feeding the same ALU units). The flow also includes a feedback path through lsuSele1, isOneSeleDelay1, and back to lsuSele1, and a release path through rele0Merge, rele2Merge, rele0Selector, rele2Selector, rs1Merge, rs2Merge, and regMerge.",
